[N 52-55 The Temple of Atal Hakkar]
[NX 52-57 Blackrock Depths]

The Temple of Atal'Hakkar lies under the Pool of Tears in the Swamp of Sorrows. Swim down into the pool and take the stairs down to the temple door (Dungeon Journal). Atal'ai trolls and Hakkari elites fill the temple; the Dungeon Journal lists it at level 49-56. The Ancient Egg needs Tablet of Theka from the Zul'Farrak guide done first.

-- Left out: 2937, 2938 and 2992-2994: Hinterlands follow-ups after Zul'Farrak that never enter the temple. 3374 and 3512: Eranikus follow-ups turned in to Itharius after the run, not part of the temple. 4148 Bloodpetal Zapper and 4144 Bloodpetal Sprouts: Un'Goro follow-ups after the dungeon. 8733 and the Eranikus chain: level 60. 5065 onward: a Blackrock Spire chain (4788/5065) that no guide carries yet. Class quests 9053/9063, 8232/8151, 8253/8250, 8418/8415, 8257/8254, 8236/8233, 8413, 8422 and 8425/8417: class chains with their own guides.

